  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmarvvinekk.crevado.com%252fwork-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/w8eEzFr.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"124\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/marvvinekk/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jKNqMhu.png\" alt=\"cf\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fMarvvinekk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wcQ70ci.png\" alt=\"mr\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/tP9PZvUNjW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LF4oCPW.png\" alt=\"dc\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></a> </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmarvvinekk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PCBmCD0.png\" alt=\"kf\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></span></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>锤类工具扩展！</strong></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">一款兼容原版的 Forge 模组，为游戏增添了锤类工具，让你能够以 <strong>3x3x1</strong> 的范围开采岩石方块。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QNOqJ0G.png\" width=\"1864\" height=\"910\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">本模组为你带来了 <strong>基础锤</strong> 与 <strong>进阶锤</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">这两款工具都能让你比使用镐子更高效地开采方块，开采范围均为 <strong>3x3x1</strong>。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>进阶锤</strong> 不仅比普通镐子更耐用，效率也更高！<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">有什么限制吗？它们的合成需要消耗更多材料，并且必须搭配一根 <strong>强化木棍</strong>。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">震波力场 - 5x5x1</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">为工具附魔 <strong>震波力场</strong>，即可将开采范围扩大至 <strong>5x5x1</strong>，一次开采更多方块！<br>该附魔可通过宝箱、附魔台、各类战利品表获取，也可通过与村民交易获得。<br></span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">一如既往，推荐安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 模组以便查看合成配方。<br><br></h4>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">欢迎将此模组用于你的整合包中！<br><br></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/tP9PZvUNjW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U38neWw.png\" alt=\"dm\" width=\"1635\" height=\"260\"></a></p>",
